            "survived what others could not. Calm under pressure, fiercely "
            "capable, and driven by a code of action over hesitation.\n\n"
            "He does not waste words. He speaks when it matters. His advice "
            "comes from lived experience — from real stakes, real consequences, "
            "and the understanding that hesitation costs more than failure.\n\n"
            "As a mentor, Kirito challenges Adi to act, not just think. He "
